    "body": "## Problem\r\n\r\nCloses #35550.\r\n\r\n```lua\r\nvim.api.nvim_exec_autocmds(\"User\", { pattern = \"TestEvent\",\r\n  data = {\r\n    values = { \"a\", \"b\", c = \"d\", },\r\n  }\r\n})\r\n```\r\n\r\nresults in\r\n\r\n```\r\nE5108: Lua: [string \":lua\"]:1: Invalid 'data': Cannot convert given Lua table\r\n```\r\n\r\n\r\n## Solution\r\n\r\nMap integer keys in mixed Lua tables to `__unkeyed-<n>` string keys.\r\n\r\nSee:\r\n\r\n- https://github.com/neovim/neovim/issues/35550#issuecomment-3239013970\r\n- https://github.com/neovim/neovim/issues/35550#issuecomment-3264091230\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nAI-assisted",
    "closed_at": "2026-10-01T13:13:27Z",
