            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "> we should at least improve the error\r\n\r\nYes\r\n\r\n> The only real argument is surprise: a Lua table passed to a Lua consumer through a Lua API fails with a confusing msgpack-conversion error.\r\n\r\nThat might point to a more fundamental fix, e.g. maybe we can skip that marshalling for in-process Lua. But I don't remember the details, so would need to review the details first.",
